<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka forex market closed for May day holiday.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka forex market closed for May day holiday.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's foreign exchange market was closed on Thursday because of the May Day holiday.</p>
<p>On Wednesday, the rupee was slightly stronger against the dollar at around 59.20 mostly on commercial demand after witnessing little activity in the previous few days.</p>
<p>Trading will resume on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
